<!-- Q&A -->
<section class="block" style="background:var(--bg-soft)">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Your questions, answered</h2>
    <p class="lead">The most common questions buyers ask before purchasing a Portuguese cut solitaire.</p>

    <div class="qa-list">
      <div class="qa-item open">
        <div class="qa-q">What makes the Portuguese cut different?</div>
        <div class="qa-a">A standard round brilliant diamond has 57 or 58 facets. Our Portuguese cut has 161+ facets — each cut and polished individually. The extra facets reflect and refract light from many more angles, which is why the Portuguese cut earns the title of the world's brightest diamond.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="qa-item">
        <div class="qa-q">Will a lab grown diamond test as a real diamond?</div>
        <div class="qa-a">Yes. Lab grown diamonds are chemically and optically identical to mined diamonds — pure crystallised carbon. They test as real diamonds on every standard diamond tester. Only a specialist laboratory machine that detects nitrogen presence can tell them apart, and even then it usually requires a CVD-grown stone.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="qa-item">
        <div class="qa-q">What does your Lifetime Buyback Policy actually mean?</div>
        <div class="qa-a">You can return your diamond ring to True Diamond at any time — 1 year later or 30 years later — and we will pay you the current market value of the diamond. Not the price you paid, the price the diamond is worth today. The metal (gold) value is also refunded at current rates. There is no expiry and no fine print.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="qa-item">
        <div class="qa-q">How does the home trial work?</div>
        <div class="qa-a">If you live in Mumbai, Hyderabad, Pune, Noida or Delhi NCR, you can book a free home trial. We send up to 3 designs (in your selected size, with replica stones) to your home for 7 days. You decide in your own time, with your own light, with the people whose opinions matter to you. There is no purchase obligation.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="qa-item">
        <div class="qa-q">Can I resize this ring after purchase?</div>
        <div class="qa-a">Yes. Under our Lifetime Exchange policy, we resize your ring up to 2 sizes either direction at any time, for free. For larger size changes we re-cast the band at material cost only. Bring it to any True Diamond store, or ship it to us insured at our expense.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="qa-item">
        <div class="qa-q">What if I want a GIA certificate instead of IGI?</div>
        <div class="qa-a">Both IGI and GIA are world-class diamond grading laboratories. IGI is the standard on lab grown diamonds and is included free with every ring. If you would prefer a GIA certificate, we can re-certify the stone with GIA at order time for an additional ₹3,500. Mention it in the order notes or during your store visit.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

